# MLB Parlay Agent

> AI-powered MLB parlay recommendation system using ML-based leg scoring, pitcher-aware matchup logic, and portfolio diversification

[![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-operational-success)](https://railway.app)
[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.10-blue)](https://python.org)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-personal%20research-lightgrey)](LICENSE)

---

## 🎯 Overview

The MLB Parlay Agent is a production system that generates daily MLB parlay recommendations by:
- Scoring 200-400 player props daily using a calibrated ML model (AUC: 0.8532)
- Applying pitcher-aware matchup analysis and handedness-split coverage rates
- Enforcing **player diversity** across all parlays (no player appears in multiple parlays)
- Building optimized 4-8 leg parlays targeting +1000 to +1500 odds
- Tracking outcomes and learning from 77,000+ historical resolved legs

**Last Major Update:** May 8, 2026 — Player diversity system deployed (40 unique players, 0% portfolio concentration)

