## 🐛 Known Issues & Limitations

### Current Issues (May 8, 2026)
1. **Dashboard shows v1 count (10) instead of v2 (18)** — Fix in progress
2. **History timestamps in 24-hour format** — Fix in progress
3. **Parlay target too high (10 vs actual 1-2)** — Lowering to 5

### Technical Limitations
1. **Player pool exhaustion:** After 40-50 players used, can only generate 1-2 more parlays
   - Daily capacity: ~10-15 total parlays
   - Trade-off accepted for diversification
   
2. **ML model conservative:** 50.5% average prediction
   - Accurate but leaves value on table
   - Retraining planned with balanced sampling

3. **No real-time updates:** Dashboard shows latest pipeline run
   - Refresh manually or wait for next scheduled run

### Data Limitations
1. **Postponed games:** Legs never resolve (stuck pending)
2. **Late scratches:** Players ruled out between 5:30 PM and game time
3. **Small sample:** Only 77k training samples (model will improve with more data)

